  "body": "* 214sqm freehold section\r\n* Prominent corner position\r\n* Located in a growing Orewa community\r\n* Close to Orewa Beach, schools, parks, cafés and shops\r\n* Convenient access to SH1 and the wider Auckland region\r\n* Build Your Future in Orewa\r\n\r\nPositioned on a prominent corner site, this 214sqm section presents an exciting opportunity to secure land in one of Orewa's growing residential communities.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to build a modern home or secure a well-positioned site for your next project, this location offers a convenient base for enjoying everything Orewa has to offer.\r\n\r\nOrewa Beach, local cafés, shops, parks and schools are all within easy reach, while future connectivity through the Flavell Drive connection is set to further enhance access to SH1.\r\n\r\nWith its corner position, practical landholding and convenient location, 21 Kopu Road is an opportunity worth considering for those looking to build in Orewa.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
